\n    <li>Airbags</li>\n    <li>Traction Control</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>\ud83d\udcba Comfort Features</h2>\n  <p>\n    The S-Class offers numerous comfort features designed to enhance the driving and passenger experience:\n  </p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Heated and Ventilated Massaging Front Seats</li>\n    <li>Air-Spring Suspension</li>\n    <li>Four-Zone Climate Control (available as a standalone option)</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>\ud83d\udccf Dimensions</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>Length:</b> 208.2 inches</li>\n    <li><b>Width:</b> 76.9 inches</li>\n    <li><b>Height:</b> 59.2 inches</li>\n    <li><b>Wheelbase:</b> 126.6 inches</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>\u2699\ufe0f Engine Specifications</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>Engine Type:</b> Inline-6 Turbocharged with EQ Boost</li>\n    <li><b>Displacement:</b> 3.0L (2999 cc)</li>\n    <li><b>Power:</b> 429 hp @ 6,100 rpm</li>\n    <li><b>Torque:</b> 384 lb-ft @ 1,800-5,800 rpm</li>\n    <li><b>Compression Ratio:</b> 10.5:1</li>\n    <li><b>Redline:</b> 6,500 rpm</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>\ud83d\ude97 Transmission Specifications</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>Transmission Type:</b> 9-Speed Automatic with Manual Mode</li>\n    <li><b>Drive System:</b> All-Wheel Drive (4MATIC)</li>\n    <li><b>Final Drive:</b> 2.82:1</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>\u2696\ufe0f Dimensions & Capacity</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>Wheelbase:</b> 126.6 inches</li>\n    <li><b>Height:</b> 59.2 inches</li>\n    <li><b>Ground Clearance:</b> 5.1 inches</li>\n    <li><b>Width:</b> 83.0 inches</li>\n    <li><b>Length:</b> 208.2 inches</li>\n    <li><b>Cargo Volume:</b> 12.8 cubic feet</li>\n    <li><b>Passenger Volume:</b> 107.0 cubic feet</li>\n    <li><b>Max Payload:</b> 1477 lbs</li>\n    <li><b>Gross Vehicle Weight Rating:</b> 6217 lbs</li>\n  </ul>\n\n    <h2>\ud83c\udf0d Geographic Distribution Analysis</h2>\n    <p>While specific geographic distribution data isn't explicitly available in the provided context, it's important to note that the Mercedes-Benz S-Class is a global luxury vehi